authors:
  - family-names: Stern
    given-names: Leonardo
abstract: >-
  Multisector industrial-reproduction and Earth-space compute
  cost-crossover models, plus an 18-sector, 17-material autonomous-bootstrap
  model with delivered-seed states, sector-resolved commissioning and repair,
  observable autonomy gates, source-transfer arcs, coupled
  compute-intelligence growth, finite shell debris, and symmetric dynamic
  economics, companion to
  "Recursive Industrial Intelligence" (r4.0, docs/). All
  structural coefficients are ASSUMPTION-class; optimized masses and
  assumption-ensemble frequencies are scenario implications, not
  measurements, probabilities, or forecasts.
